WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.792
The bolt reaches into the frame. The levers sit across the path of its stump.

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:07.208
Each step on the key holds a lever at the height its gate needs.

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:10.792
The key now draws the bolt back. The stump travels through the aligned gates.

00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:15.000
The bolt has cleared the frame, and the door swings open.
